# IDL files for protocol verification
#
# To add a protocol IDL:
# 1. Fetch: solana idl fetch <PROGRAM_ID> -o idls/<protocol>.json
# 2. Compute hash: sha256sum idls/<protocol>.json | cut -d' ' -f1
# 3. Add entry to EXPECTED_IDL_HASHES in build.rs
# 4. Enable verification: cargo build --features idl-verify
